</div></div><div class="jdgm-rev-widg__body">  <div class="jdgm-rev-widg__reviews"><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="b2a1a400-149d-4572-ab03-37176d0ee021" data-review-language="" data-product-title="Vitamina D3 y K2" data-product-url="{{ product.url }}" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reseña de 5 estrellas" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-09-08T17:20:45Z" data-content="2025-09-08 17:20:45 UTC">09/08/2025</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Dawn A.</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">¡Me encanta!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>Es una forma muy práctica de obtener los dos nutrientes en uno. Me encanta que sea libre de transgénicos, sin gluten y sin soya, algo importante para mí. Las cápsulas blandas son pequeñas y fáciles de tragar. Muy recomendable si buscas cuidar tus huesos y tu sistema inmune.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__pics">  <a class="jdgm-rev__pic-link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/me.judge.review-images/true-nutra/1757689991__1757689987679-image1918__huge.png" data-mfp-src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/me.judge.review-images/true-nutra/1757689991__1757689987679-image1918__huge.png" aria-label="Dawn A. review photo 1"> <img class="jdgm-rev__pic-img" alt="Dawn A. review photo" data-src="{{ 'tn-1757689991__1757689987679-image1918__compact.png' | asset_url }}" src="{{ 'tn-1757689991__1757689987679-image1918__compact.png' | asset_url }}"> </a>  </div>  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_another_provider" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Reseña recopilada de otro proveedor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="af0f3524-0fb9-488b-8483-4995278c9141" data-review-language="" data-product-title="Vitamina D3 y K2" data-product-url="{{ product.url }}" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reseña de 5 estrellas" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-09-08T17:20:45Z" data-content="2025-09-08 17:20:45 UTC">09/08/2025</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Naomi S.</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">Ideal si respondes lento al GLP-1</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>Bueno, mi GLP-1 iba lentísimo. Estaba bajando de peso, pero muy despacio. Entonces probé esto y ¡guau! Fue como apretar el botón de avance rápido. ¡En solo 4 semanas bajé 10 libras! Ojalá mi doctor me lo hubiera dicho antes.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div>   <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_another_provider" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Reseña recopilada de otro proveedor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="327478e2-0f62-4f46-af1d-8e602c4da3b3" data-review-language="" data-product-title="Vitamina D3 y K2" data-product-url="{{ product.url }}" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jdgm-rev__rating" data-score="5" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reseña de 5 estrellas" role="img"> <span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span><span class="jdgm-star jdgm--on"></span> </span><time class="jdgm-rev__timestamp" datetime="2025-09-08T17:20:45Z" data-content="2025-09-08 17:20:45 UTC">09/08/2025</time></div><div class="jdgm-row-profile"><div class="jdgm-rev__icon"></div><span class="jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"> <span class="jdgm-rev__author">Barbara Z.</span>   </span></div><div class="jdgm-row-extra"><span class="jdgm-rev__location">  </span></div>         <div class="jdgm-rev__br"></div>   </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__content">   <b class="jdgm-rev__title">¡Funciona de maravilla!</b> <div class="jdgm-rev__body"><p>Llevo unos meses tomando la Vitamina D3 + K2 de True Nutra y estoy muy impresionada. La dosis es justo lo que buscaba, y que incluya K2 es un gran plus porque ayuda al cuerpo a absorber y aprovechar mejor la vitamina D. Me gusta que las cápsulas sean pequeñas y fáciles de tragar, sin ningún regusto raro.
<br>También valoro que esta marca sea limpia: sin rellenos, colorantes artificiales ni aditivos innecesarios. El empaque es sencillo pero viene bien sellado y mantiene las cápsulas frescas. Me siento con más energía y he notado mi ánimo más equilibrado desde que las tomo, sobre todo en los meses con poca luz solar. En conjunto, es un suplemento de gran calidad a muy buen precio. Sin duda seguiré comprando esta marca.</p></div><div class="jdgm-rev__custom-form">  </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__pics">  <a class="jdgm-rev__pic-link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/me.judge.review-images/true-nutra/1757692498__1757692282807-image1929__huge.png" data-mfp-src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/me.judge.review-images/true-nutra/1757692498__1757692282807-image1929__huge.png" aria-label="Barbara Z. review photo 1"> <img class="jdgm-rev__pic-img" alt="Barbara Z. review photo" data-src="{{ 'tn-1757692498__1757692282807-image1929__compact.png' | asset_url }}" src="{{ 'tn-1757692498__1757692282807-image1929__compact.png' | asset_url }}"> </a>  </div>  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge-wrapper">  <div class="jdgm-rev__transparency-badge" data-badge-type="review_collected_from_another_provider" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 8px; margin-right: 2px; border-radius: 0px; border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);">Reseña recopilada de otro proveedor</div>  </div> </div> <div class="jdgm-rev__actions"> <div class="jdgm-rev__social"></div> <div class="jdgm-rev__votes"></div> </div>  </div><div class="jdgm-rev jdgm-divider-top jdgm--done-setup" data-verified-buyer="false" data-review-id="5e99ab1b-34b7-4436-9232-a728a32d1f97" data-review-language="" data-product-title="Vitamina D3 y K2" data-product-url="{{ product.url }}" data-thumb-up-count="0" data-thumb-down-count="0"> <div class="jdgm-rev__header"><div class="jdgm-row-product"></div><div class="jdgm-row-rating"><span class="jd